  "decision": "adapt_existing",
  "reason": "Reuse accepted extended-real proximal one-step, canonical divergence/properness/global-support definitions, Option recursion and local fderiv congruence. Existing affine prescient projection is a total quadratic/affine specialization, while current subgradient recursion chooses a support before projected update; neither supplies arbitrary extended-real current-whole-loss partial argmin recursion. The causal and partiality interfaces have distinct actual consumers in the four complete canaries and final same-run one-step. No duplicate foundational library, dependency change or generalized new search theorem is introduced.",
